      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201504/2002015040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、灯織が撮影している間に連絡が来てたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "予定通り終わりそうだから、\r\n報告と書類提出のために事務所に寄るって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それぞれから個別で",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015040020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201504/2002015040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015040030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ\r\n最近、ちょっと似てきたところがあるんですよね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201504/2002015040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015040040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "同じタイミングで\r\n同じことを考えていたり、同じことを言ったり",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201504/2002015040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織たち、俺がいる時もそういうことあるよな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "３人と一緒に話していると、\r\n同じタイミングで首をかしげてたりしてさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015040050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え……そうなんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201504/2002015040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、きょうだい──みんな同い年だから三つ子か\r\n三つ子かなって時々思うくらい揃ってるんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "気付いてなかったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015040060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201504/2002015040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015040070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーへのリアクションということは、\r\nみんなプロデューサーのほうを見ていると思うので",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201504/2002015040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015040080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "真乃とめぐるがどういう動きをしているかは\r\n全然……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201504/2002015040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015040090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なんだか恥ずかしいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201504/2002015040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恥ずかしいことなんてないよ\r\n仲が良くてなによりだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015040100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……\r\nその話、ふたりが事務所に来たらもう一回してくださいね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201504/2002015040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　うん、いいけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "理由あるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015040110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………このままじゃ私だけ恥ずかしいじゃないですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
